      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. insert(int val) ==> assigns initial value to the \nroot of the tree and recursively inserts other nodes\n\n2. fillNode(Scanner sc , Node root)\n    if we have to insert value to the left of the Node then\n    root.left = new Node(value);\n    fillNode(sc,root.left)  ==> filling Node of the newly added Node  ",
